          %h3#CosetSpaceRealization Coset space realizations
          #QuotientOfSpin7ByG2IsS7.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coset+space"} coset space
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%287%29"} Spin(7)
                by
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
                is
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/7-sphere"} 7-sphere
            %p
              Consider the canonical
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%287%29"} Spin(7)
              on the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unit+sphere"} unit sphere
              in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mn 8
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^8
              (the
              = succeed ")," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/7-sphere"} 7-sphere
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  This action is is
                  = succeed ";" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transitive+action"} transitive
              %li
                %p
                  the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stabilizer+group"} stabilizer group
                  of any point on
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mn 7
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^7
                  is
                  = succeed ";" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
              %li
                %p
                  all
                  = succeed "-subgroups" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%287%29"} Spin(7)
                  arise this way, and are all
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conjugate+subgroup"} conjugate
                  to each other.
            %p
              Hence the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coset+space"} coset space
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%287%29"} Spin(7)
              by
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/7-sphere"} 7-sphere
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mn 7
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %msub
                      %mo ≃
                      %mi diff
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mi Spin
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 7
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mn 2
                    %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                    %mo .
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    S^7
                    \\;\simeq_{diff}\;
                    Spin(7)/G_2
                    \\,.
          %p
            (e.g
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Varadarajan01"} Varadarajan 01, Theorem 3
          %p
            Other coset realizations of the usual
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differentiable+manifold"} differentiable
            7-sphere (
            %a{:href => "#Choquet-Bruhat+DeWitt-Morette00"}> Choquet-Bruhat, DeWitt-Morette 00, p. 288
            ):
          %ul
